title: Lap of the Wren
from: Zeke Torres
gist: On the Lap of the Wren, the old hands gave Tomas his crossing at the bow lounge door.
== lines
torres-zeke: Hold up. Stop here, everyone. This is where it happened today.   [gesture]
torres-zeke: Tomas Lind. You missed your Line watching the ship. So here it is.
torres-zeke: From today, this reach knows your name, Lind.   [nod]
pell: And the last of the punch. I saved it. It's not got better.   [laugh]
tomas: That's... thank you. That's the nicest thing. It's horrible. Thank you.   [laugh]
